From cb565888cc5296a869375cb9fed7fe89298dd088 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:46:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 11/56] Guide overlay: confirmations as xam message boxes in
 the ErrorHUD

hud.xex (2.0.2858) answers Y "Xbox Dashboard" in a game and "Shut Down"
with XamShowMessageBox(title = the button's caption, Strings.xus 15 / 44,
{Yes, No}, focus No, warning icon). xam shows it with the skin's
XuiMessageBox3 visual (buttons + a hidden cancel) in hudbkgnd's right-side
ErrorHUD: HalfToError (the Guide slides out, then the ErrorHUD in),
ErrorToHalf on No/B, ErrorToClosed on Guide, ClosedToError when opened
straight into it. Replaces the left-side InfoMessage dialogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
